<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
{% if site.favicon_file is defined and site.favicon_file %}
<link rel="icon" href="{{ site.favicon_file }}">
{% else %}
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
{% endif %}
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Page introuvable | {{ site.name }}</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="{{ theme.google_fonts }}&v={{ site.slug }}" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:{{ theme.bg }};
  --surface:#fff;
  --surface2:#F0ECE5;
  --ink:{{ theme.ink }};
  --ink2:#6B6560;
  --ink3:#A09890;
  --accent:{{ theme.accent }};
  --accent2:{{ theme.accent2 }};--cta:{{ theme.cta_color if theme.cta_color is defined and theme.cta_color else "#F59E0B" }};--cta-text:{{ theme.cta_text_color if theme.cta_text_color is defined and theme.cta_text_color else "#ffffff" }};
  --border:#E2DDD6;
  --r:12px;
  --r2:20px;
  --green:#1A7A4A;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:'{{ theme.font_body }}',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-size:16px;line-height:1.75}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}

/* ── NAV ── */
nav{background:var(--ink);padding:0 5vw;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:64px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100}
.nav-inner{max-width:1200px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;position:relative}
.nav-logo{font-family:'{{ theme.font_title }}',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0}.nav-logo span{color:var(--accent2)}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:30px;padding:4px 8px;position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}
.nav-links a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:24px;transition:.15s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
.nav-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:24px;background:var(--cta);color:var(--cta-text);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;transition:.15s;flex-shrink:0}
.nav-cta:hover{opacity:.88}
.nav-burger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;cursor:pointer;padding:8px;background:none;border:none}
.nav-burger span{display:block;width:22px;height:2px;background:#fff;border-radius:2px;transition:.25s}
.nav-mobile{display:none;position:absolute;top:64px;left:0;right:0;background:var(--ink);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);padding:16px 5vw;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;z-index:99}
.nav-mobile.open{display:flex}
.nav-mobile a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);font-size:15px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;transition:.15s}
.nav-mobile a:hover{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)}


*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:'{{ theme.font_body }}',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
main{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:40px 5vw;text-align:center}
.code{font-family:'{{ theme.font_title }}',serif;font-size:clamp(80px,15vw,160px);font-weight:400;color:var(--accent);line-height:1;margin-bottom:16px;opacity:.15}
h1{font-family:'{{ theme.font_title }}',serif;font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,40px);font-weight:400;margin-bottom:12px}
p{font-size:17px;color:#718096;margin-bottom:32px;max-width:480px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;line-height:1.7}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:.15s}
.btn:hover{background:var(--cta,var(--accent2))}
.links{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}
.link-sec{color:var(--accent);font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
.link-sec:hover{background:var(--border)}

</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="nav-logo">{% if site.logo_img is defined and site.logo_img %}<img src="{{ site.logo_img }}" alt="{{ site.name }}" style="height:36px;width:auto;object-fit:contain;vertical-align:middle">{% else %}{{ site.logo_text }}<span>{{ site.logo_accent }}</span>{% endif %}</a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/nos-comparateurs">Nos comparateurs</a>
    </div>
    <a href="/contact" class="nav-cta">Contact</a>
    <button class="nav-burger" id="burger" onclick="toggleMenu()" aria-label="Menu">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="nav-mobile" id="nav-mobile">
    <a href="/nos-comparateurs">Nos comparateurs</a>
    <a href="/contact" class="nav-cta">Contact</a>
  </div>
</nav>
<main>
  <div>
    <div class="code">404</div>
    <h1>Page introuvable</h1>
    <p>La page que vous recherchez n'existe pas ou a été déplacée. Revenez à l'accueil pour trouver votre comparatif.</p>
    <a href="/" class="btn">← Retour à l'accueil</a>
    <div class="links">
      {% if page_types is defined and 'classement' in page_types %}
      <a href="/nos-comparateurs" class="link-sec">Nos comparateurs</a>
      {% else %}
      <a href="/comparatifs-scpi" class="link-sec">Comparatifs</a>
      <a href="/avis-scpi" class="link-sec">Avis</a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
{% include "base/_footer.html.j2" %}
</body>
</html>
